  "cards": [
    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Surface", "items": [
      "append(event) and read(scope), in-process — no HTTP route of any kind",
      "Six modules append; prompt-registry and release-control also read",
      "registered_actions() hands the vocabulary out as data, so tests assert it",
      "No router, no /healthz, no /readyz — checked against the route table (A-123)"
    ] },
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Inside", "items": [
      "Two tables in the history schema, and it reads nothing outside them",
      "The vocabulary is loaded once at process start and never refreshed (ADR-0038)",
      "check_event() refuses three ways: unknown action, unknown key, no reason",
      "seq is GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY and is the only sort key (A-125)"
    ] },
    { "dot": "rose", "title": "Guarantees", "items": [
      "Rows are never deleted: prope_app holds SELECT and INSERT only (ADR-0025)",
      "actor_id and target_id are values, not foreign keys — a tombstone is free (A-122)",
      "The event commits in the caller's transaction, or neither does (ADR-0023)",
      "It depends on nothing; every edge on this page points inward (A-044)"
    ] }
  ]
